  "name": "Rotation assistance: a Cultist healer's rotation shields an injured ally with Void Shield",
  "contract": [
    "Cultist specialization 40 heals and lists Void Shield first for an ally below 25% health. Void Shield",
    "only absorbs damage, so the healing rotation used to skip it as a spell that does not heal. Expected:",
    "a level 20 Cultist of specialization 40 with Void Shield (500715) selects an ally at 10 health; the",
    "CoARotation preview is Void Shield and a press shields the ally. While the shield holds, the preview no",
    "longer offers it."
  ],
